{
  "id": "LUK.5",
  "number": "5",
  "bookId": "LUK",
  "reference": "Luka 5",
  "verseCount": 39,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu gaguursa giinealanga madeeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweecha nea gwanda murdeeda basooda Genesareti gwaneaweesa buuneeda nea gooleeysiit ng'asheega ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwadaa maleambaji iyeenya aba murdeeda basooda, nea abeeda ea niweay fiibwa goohuun gheareedanga nyaawa siing'oonya ghweayeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawa jeemba maleamboonagi was dea Simon, gwayeesha seabwa nung' goosiipta maleambooda gil mwanang' gawa jeeda basooda ak goopteada ak ghoanaal buuneeda nea gwanda jeeda maleambooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rat ghuuta baloolda, gwayeesha Simon, “Asiipsiina heeda saang'a beega, ak ghoapuuti gheareedangeagwa alealni ghweayeega.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Simon nea gwayeesha, “Siida haw, geegadiiyi eaweesean ak ea moang'waanyi gil! Ama ninyaashtunu gaydaabuuta gheareedanga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata sinoodeaba nih, ghoang'waay ghweayeega saang'a; ea ghwariikghta gang'ada gheareedanga nyaawa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gang'wachsa geadi fiisu mida jeemba maleambooni neeki ghapka ghaweat. Geegawusa maleambajeega duwaawi ea gwaramagu gwalik beega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daah Simon Betaro ng'asheanji, goobeedeaysa madeeda Yesu nea gwayeesha, “Ea Ng'utamiida, asiipteawana heedeanyu, aba gideaba geabea riing'a.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghahamng'eanyi sea fugiga sean mideayiin, aba ghweayeega siing'waay; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea abeeda gwanda Yakobo ea Yohana was orjooga Sebedayo sinuudayi gadiyeeda sea Simon. Ng'ata gwayeesha Yesu Simon, “Adibeali; ghang'eada ghamneawa gaylealuuni buuneeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aruuna maleambajeega nyaawa jeeda basooda ghang'eatng'eat gwanung'usa heeda haleanjeeda sean ak geayaat geeshta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ghoahaap siida",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweecha nea gwanda jeemba mujiinajean, ghwahidu headaanyi Siisi bearji udamusuura, dea Yesu, goobeedeaysa madeadaanyi ak gamus nea gwayeesha, “Ng'utamiida, iigasayi giimuusi amiinaan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghoahaakta geadi Yesu ak ghawaas nea gwayi, “Geagasayi; miini.” Deagheata gwariteaysa udamusuura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghamiin gheang'da ea marukusiina sih; nea gwayeesha, “Una ahiimsiina geaw ashoohoocheanda, ak gisabi geadi haleanjeeda siyeada ghadooweeda was gidaghayi rukuteayda Musa, asi abeeda gajeadaah gideaba siimiineey.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gageawiit iita aba darooraka sean, ak ghapka eemeeda headaanyi gooleeysiit nea ghoahaap fuga bearji geeyoonung'weaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gwajiireada ak gawa dareapcheeda ghamwaash ASEETA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ghoahaap siida abitu damealga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweecheanjagi aba jeedeaba eawoojigiga goonealshi, abeeda goobiitpiit Farisaayajeega ea giinealshoodiga deaweeda leabu gilinyoo ea gharang'da Galilaya, ea Yudeya ea gealeabu Yerusalemu; nea gwandeawa uurda Ng'utamiida ak ghoahaap buuneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ng'ula, ghapka buuneeda nea gwasareena muunda siisi abitu damealga, ak geegasa gichea eayaata gah, ak geayiin madeeda Yesu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iidu nea mwanyasa gheata gichea gweateayda gah aba seang'ayda eemeeda, gwading'da uhuuda gheeda ak geerareang'u sea muundaanyi gwasku seawadeeda ea eayiin madeeda Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daah masaweega nyaawa gwayi, “Siida, sisamsa riing'eagaagu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goonyeari geat Farisaayajeega ea ng'oorshoodiga nea gwayeena, “Siisi ng'eaha ang'eawi ASEETEAN ghanyea manda siisi ammu gwasamsa riing'eeda geaghus ASEETA ak ghwahit.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jeeng'u Yesu ng'asheega anyeari geat gwayeesha, “Ghwasaan anda goonyearayi geat ng'asheesu aba gurooruunatkeagwa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea wusis aneeda, gideaba dayi, ‘Riing'eagaagu sisamsa,’ ghana dayi, ‘Ng'eada ak guwi’? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi geagasayi anala gideaba Orjeeda Siida gwandeawa gheambalmeeda aba jeeda ng'eanyiida jea gwasamsiina riing'eega” iidu gwayeesha siidida abitu damealgeani, “geayi, ng'eada, sareana muundaang'u ak guwi ghoah.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deagheata ghang'eat siidida aba madeenyaawa, ak ghwasar muundaanyi ak gawa ghoah nea ghoaghaambiit ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghahamng'eanyi sean, nea geakghambiit ASEETA nea ghang'ut muuwda nea geeyi, “Eanean sidaayi ng'asheega deamdeameadi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu gaguursa Lawi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gwarita jarooda ak ghwadaah siisi ang'oonyi gwaadi siguura Lawi, nea goopteada aba gheeda siing'waanya gwaadiin; ak gwayeesha, “Eani geeshteanyu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eat ak gwanung'usa heeda haleanjeeda sean, ak ghwaat geeshta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwasissa Lawi ghweelmeeda haw aba gheanyi; ak gweagiischi nea gambuuchi fuga saang'a ang'oonyi gwaadi ea buuneeda suurja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gooniiksa Farisaayajeega ea ng'oorshoodiga nyaawa ginealangaaschi, nea gwayeesha, “Ghwasaan anda gooyeagiischi nea gooleeshi sea fuga ang'oonyi gwaadi ea fuga riing'eega?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Yesu nea gwayeesha, “Fuga majeekcheewi magaseadayi meang'nyeanda geaghus gagasa gea miyeani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aniini mwaawuni daguursa fuga doobiiweadi, ghaawunyi daguursa fuga riing'eega gwaduukuuna riing'eega nyaawa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iita giiluuldeaydeaba geaw",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geeyeesha, “Anda giinealanga Yohana gooluuliida geat nea ghamwaash ASEETA, ak eara giinealanga Farisaayajeega gwasiniidunu, nea gaagu gweagiischi nea gwaleeshi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yesu, “Ghoamu gwalilda rabasta nyeangiida nea gwandeayi sea siida geeshi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadu gwanda eaweeda jea eegeandeawa siida geeshi aba jeenyaawa, eaweecheanji gaygwalilda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwarukusa galeega nea gwayeesha, “Manda siida jea ghabwaash weasta hang'deesh ak ghawaasa hang'da waas, iisindunu gayghabwaash dea eesh, ak abeeda weastida bea hang'deeshiin maygweateayi sea dea waas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea manda siida jea ghwayiin difaayeeda mii ghwaheas jeesinga ghadeatka woosi; iisindunu, gaygwanyarjeaweada difaayeeda mii ghwaheas ghadeatka ak gaygaweay difaayeeda, ak gwanyara ghadeatka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Difaayeeda mii ghwaheas geaghus eeyamsa jeesinga ghadeatka eeshish. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea manda siida jea iing'ata leeyda difaayeeda heeseadi jea gagasa gea mii heeseadi; aba gideaba gaygwayi, ‘Gea heeseadi aamiyaas.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
